            "snippets": [
              "# Rare Earths: China's Competitive Advantage In The U.S. Trade War\n### Copy the code below to embed the WBUR audio player on your site\nRare earth minerals are essential to everything from cellphones to hybrid cars. China’s got them and could use them as leverage in the trade war with the U.S",
              "### From The Reading List\n**Bloomberg**: \"Why Rare Earths Could Give China a Trade War Cudgel\" — \"U.S. President Donald Trump’s threat to cut off the supply of chips and processors to Huawei Technologies Co. is hitting China’s biggest tech company where it hurts – its dependence on other nations for the semiconductors and software used in smartphones and networking gear",
